  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Rajesh Omprakash Rathi vs The State Of Maharashtra on 29 July, 2025 1295.25aba (1) In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad 916 Anticipatory Bail Application No. 1295 Of 2025 Rajesh Omprakash Rathi Versus The State Of Maharashtra ..... Mr G. K. Naik Thigle, Advocate for Applicant. Mr S. B. Narwade, App for respondent/State. .....",
    "facts": "4. The Application is filed under Section 482 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, as the Applicant apprehends arrest. The proceedings relate to Crime No.0420/2025. The FIR is dated 08 July 2025 at 21:42 hours registered by the Pathari Police Station, District Parbhani. The occurrence of the alleged offence is shown on 08 July 2025. The informant is one Santosh Uttamrao Maral, aged 36 years who is P.S.I. of the Pathari Police Station. 5. According to the learned Advocate for the Applicant the name of the present Applicant has surfaced for the first time on the statement of the co-accused during the investigation. The learned APP Mr Narwade would state that the Applicant is the supplier of the said unauthorized product. 6. At the outset, it is pointed out that the product involved here is scented Jarda (scented Gutkha). The parties would agree that this product involves the issue covered by the orders passed in Anticipatory Bail Application No.857/2025 and other companion Anticipatory Bail Applications.",
